      "quote": "Does not have third,fourth,or,fifth grade on it"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R326]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports that the app includes in-app purchases or subscription traps, as they mention it is free but imply potential hidden costs.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "I always love teaching my kids but sometimes I need a little help. It is the perfect way for me to work with one child while the other is still learning! My 4 year old knows his ABC and the sound of all the letters. Substitute this for any video game and your kid will be better off! I even like letting my kids play it in the car! Highly recommend! Best free learning game!"
    },
    {
